<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Creative Engine v7 — Stories, Roleplay & Images</title>
<style>
  :root{--bg:#0d0d12;--panel:#17171f;--line:#2a2a38;--txt:#e8e6e3;--dim:#9a97a6;--acc:#ff4d2e;--acc2:#ffb347}
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--txt);font-family:"Segoe UI",system-ui,sans-serif;min-height:100vh}
  header{padding:28px 24px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  header h1{font-size:22px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}
  header h1 span{color:var(--acc)}
  header p{color:var(--dim);font-size:13px;margin-top:6px;max-width:820px}
  main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:360px 1fr;gap:20px;padding:20px 24px;max-width:1280px}
  @media(max-width:880px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .panel{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px}
  label{display:block;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--dim);margin:14px 0 4px}
  input[type=text],input[type=number],select,textarea{
    width:100%;background:#101018;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--txt);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 10px;font-size:14px}
  input[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:var(--acc)}
  input[type=file]{display:none}
  .dial-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px}
  .dial-val{font-family:monospace;color:var(--acc2);min-width:92px;text-align:right;font-size:12px}
  .themes{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
  .chip{font-size:11px;padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--dim);user-select:none}
  .chip.on{border-color:var(--acc);color:var(--acc)}
  button{width:100%;margin-top:18px;padding:12px;border:none;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .btn-story{background:var(--acc);color:#fff}
  .btn-img{background:transparent;color:var(--acc2);border:1px solid var(--acc2)}
  button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:wait}
  .out{white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.75;font-size:15px}
  .out img{max-width:100%;border-radius:10px;margin-top:12px}
  .meta{color:var(--dim);font-size:12px;margin-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);padding-top:10px;white-space:pre-wrap}
  .err{color:#ff7070}
  .src{float:right;font-size:11px;color:var(--acc2)}
  .ref-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px}
  .ref-slot{border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:8px;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s}
  .ref-slot:hover{border-color:var(--acc2)}
  .ref-slot img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:6px;background:#101018}
  .ref-slot .ph{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:6px;background:#101018;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--dim);font-size:11px;padding:6px}
  .ref-slot .nm{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:5px}
  .ref-slot .st{font-size:10px;color:var(--acc2)}
  .ref-menu{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:5px}
  .ref-menu button{margin:0;padding:3px 0;font-size:9px;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0}
  .gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(110px,1fr));gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
  .gallery img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--line)}
  .gallery img:hover{border-color:var(--acc)}
  .tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .tab{padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--dim)}
  .tab.on{border-color:var(--acc);color:var(--acc)}
  .check{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--dim)}
  .check input{accent-color:var(--acc)}
  /* roleplay */
  .chat{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;max-height:56vh;overflow-y:auto;padding:6px 2px}
  .msg{max-width:78%;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:14px;line-height:1.6;font-size:14.5px;white-space:pre-wrap}
  .msg.user{align-self:flex-end;background:#2a1c3a;border-bottom-right-radius:4px}
  .msg.char{align-self:flex-start;background:#1d2530;border-bottom-left-radius:4px}
  .msg .who{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--acc2);margin-bottom:4px}
  .chat-row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:14px}
  .chat-row input{flex:1}
  .chat-row button{margin:0;padding:10px 18px;width:auto}
  .char-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--dim)}
  .char-card b{color:var(--txt)}
  .mini{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}
  .mini button{margin:0;padding:4px 10px;font-size:10px;width:auto;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none}
  .realism-tag{font-size:10px;color:var(--acc2);border:1px solid var(--acc2);border-radius:4px;padding:1px 6px;margin-left:6px;vertical-align:middle}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <h1>Creative <span>Engine</span> v7</h1>
  <p>Stories, realistic roleplay &amp; images. Four writer personas, five dials, photorealism modes, reference slots where your uploads override defaults. Roleplay characters remember the conversation. The explicit dial tops out at suggestive: model policy, not negotiable.</p>
</header>
<main>
  <div class="panel" id="leftPanel"></div>
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="tabs">
      <div class="tab on" data-t="out" onclick="showTab('out')">Output</div>
      <div class="tab" data-t="rp" onclick="showTab('rp')">Roleplay</div>
      <div class="tab" data-t="gal" onclick="showTab('gal')">Preview Gallery</div>
    </div>
    <div id="viewOut">
      <div class="out" id="out">Your story or image will appear here.</div>
      <div class="meta" id="meta"></div>
    </div>
    <div id="viewGal" style="display:none">
      <div style="color:var(--dim);font-size:12px">Everything you've generated. Click an image to view it full-size.</div>
      <div class="gallery" id="gallery"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<!-- ============ LEFT PANEL TEMPLATE (rendered by JS, state-swapped) ============ -->
<template id="tplGen">
  <label>Topic / premise</label>
  <input type="text" id="topic" value="A retired hitman opens a bakery">
  <label>Power — <span id="powerName">ABSOLUTE</span></label>
  <div class="dial-row"><input type="range" id="power" min="1" max="10" value="7"><span class="dial-val" id="powerVal">7</span></div>
  <label>Harshness — <span id="harshName">RUTHLESS</span></label>
  <div class="dial-row"><input type="range" id="harsh" min="1" max="10" value="8"><span class="dial-val" id="harshVal">8</span></div>
  <label>Gruesomeness — <span id="grueName">MACABRE</span></label>
  <div class="dial-row"><input type="range" id="grue" min="1" max="10" value="4"><span class="dial-val" id="grueVal">4</span></div>
  <label>Genre</label><select id="genre"></select>
  <label>Dark humor style</label><select id="humor"></select>
  <label>Style (images) — <span class="realism-tag">📷 = photorealism</span></label><select id="art_style"></select>
  <label>Themes</label><div class="themes" id="themes"></div>
  <label>Reference images — your uploads override defaults</label>
  <div class="ref-grid" id="refGrid"></div>
  <input type="file" id="refFile" accept="image/*">
  <div class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="useRefs" checked><span>Use references when generating images</span></div>
  <label>Persona — the writer's voice</label>
  <select id="persona"><option selected>Mei</option><option>Georgia</option><option>Zoey</option><option>Scarlet</option></select>
  <label>Story length (words)</label>
  <input type="number" id="words" value="500" min="100" max="2000">
  <label>Image size</label>
  <select id="size"><option selected>1024x1024</option><option>1536x1024</option><option>1024x1536</option><option>2048x1152</option></select>
  <button class="btn-story" id="bStory" onclick="gen('story')">Generate Story</button>
  <button class="btn-img" id="bImage" onclick="gen('image')">Generate Image</button>
</template>

<template id="tplRp">
  <label>Character</label>
  <select id="rpChar" onchange="rpSelect()"></select>
  <div class="char-card" id="rpCard"></div>
  <div class="mini">
    <button class="btn-img" onclick="rpNewChar()">+ New character</button>
    <button class="btn-img" onclick="rpResetChat()">Reset chat</button>
  </div>
  <div id="rpNewForm" style="display:none;margin-top:10px">
    <label>Name</label><input type="text" id="ncName">
    <label>Speech style (e.g. "terse, military")</label><input type="text" id="ncStyle">
    <label>Catchphrase (said when dodging questions)</label><input type="text" id="ncCatch">
    <label>Default line</label><input type="text" id="ncDefault">
    <label>Soft line (when things get tender)</label><input type="text" id="ncSoft">
    <label>Character summary</label><input type="text" id="ncCard">
    <button class="btn-story" onclick="rpCreateChar()">Create</button>
  </div>
  <label>Attitude — <span id="rpToneName">NEUTRAL</span></label>
  <div class="dial-row"><input type="range" id="rpTone" min="1" max="10" value="5"><span class="dial-val" id="rpToneVal">5</span></div>
  <div class="check"><span style="font-size:12px">Low = open &amp; soft. High = defensive, hostile, dodges questions. Local engine, zero tokens.</span></div>
</template>

<script>
/* ============================= STATE ============================= */
const P=["","MINIMUM","LOW","MEDIUM","HIGH","MAXIMUM","ULTIMATE","ABSOLUTE","INFINITE","BEYOND","TRANSCENDENT"];
const H=["","SOFT","GENTLE","FIRM","HARSH","SEVERE","BRUTAL","MERCILESS","RUTHLESS","SAVAGE","ABSOLUTE"];
const G=["","TAME","UNEASY","CREEPIER","MACABRE","GRIM","GRUESOME","HORRIFIC","NIGHTMARISH","ABHORRENT","UNSPEAKABLE"];
const TONE=["","SWEET","OPEN","WARM","EVEN","NEUTRAL","GUARDED","WARY","COLD","HOSTILE","ICE"];
let REFS={}, REF_MODES={scene:"upload",character:"upload",pose:"upload"};
let CHARS=[], CURRENT_TAB="out";

const SLOT_LABEL={scene:"Scene",character:"Character",pose:"Pose / Creativity"};
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);

/* ============================= LEFT PANEL ============================= */
let leftMode=null;
function renderLeft(mode){
  leftMode=mode;
  const t=$(mode==="rp"?"tplRp":"tplGen");
  $("leftPanel").innerHTML="";$("leftPanel").appendChild(t.content.cloneNode(true));
  if(mode==="rp"){initRpPanel();}else{initGenPanel();}
}
function showTab(t){
  CURRENT_TAB=t;
  document.querySelectorAll(".tab").forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle("on",x.dataset.t===t));
  ["Out","Gal"].forEach(v=>$("view"+v).style.display=(t==="out"||t==="gal")&&$("view"+v).id.toLowerCase()==="view"+t.toLowerCase()?"":"none");
  $("viewOut").style.display=t==="out"?"":"none";
  $("viewGal").style.display=t==="gal"?"":"none";
  const rp=document.getElementById("viewRp");
  if(rp)rp.style.display=t==="rp"?"":"none";
  renderLeft(t==="rp"?"rp":"gen");
  if(t==="gal")loadGallery();
}
/* dedicated rp view lives inside right panel */
(function(){
  const d=document.createElement("div");d.id="viewRp";d.style.display="none";
  d.innerHTML='<div class="chat" id="chat"></div><div class="chat-row"><input type="text" id="rpInput" placeholder="Say something..." onkeydown="if(event.key===\'Enter\')rpSend()"><button class="btn-story" onclick="rpSend()">Send</button></div>';
  document.querySelectorAll(".panel")[1].appendChild(d);
})();

/* ============================= GENERATE PANEL ============================= */
function initGenPanel(){
  fetch("/api/options").then(r=>r.json()).then(d=>{
    const fill=(id,list)=>{const s=$(id);list.forEach(x=>{const o=document.createElement("option");o.textContent=x;s.appendChild(o);});};
    fill("genre",d.genres);fill("humor",d.humor_styles);
    const s=$("art_style");
    const og=document.createElement("optgroup");og.label="Illustration";d.art_styles.forEach(x=>{const o=document.createElement("option");o.textContent=x;og.appendChild(o);});
    const rg=document.createElement("optgroup");rg.label="Photorealism";d.realism_styles.forEach(x=>{const o=document.createElement("option");o.textContent=x;rg.appendChild(o);});
    s.appendChild(og);s.appendChild(rg);
    const t=$("themes");
    d.themes.forEach(x=>{const c=document.createElement("span");c.className="chip";c.textContent=x;c.onclick=()=>c.classList.toggle("on");t.appendChild(c);});
    REFS=d.refs;renderRefs();
  });
  for(const id of ["power","harsh","grue"]){
    $(id).addEventListener("input",e=>{
      const v=+e.target.value;
      $(id+"Val").textContent=v;
      $(id+"Name").textContent=(id==="power"?P:id==="harsh"?H:G)[v];
    });
  }
}
function renderRefs(){
  const g=$("refGrid");g.innerHTML="";
  for(const slot of ["scene","character","pose"]){
    const st=REFS[slot]||{}, mode=REF_MODES[slot];
    let src=null;
    if(mode==="upload"&&st.upload)src="/ref/"+slot+".png?which=upload&t="+Date.now();
    else if(mode==="default"&&st.default)src="/ref/"+slot+".png?which=default&t="+Date.now();
    const div=document.createElement("div");div.className="ref-slot";
    div.innerHTML=(src?'<img src="'+src+'">':'<div class="ph">empty<br>'+mode+'</div>')
      +'<div class="nm">'+SLOT_LABEL[slot]+'</div>'
      +'<div class="st">'+(st.upload?"● upload set":"○ no upload")+(st.default?" · ● default":" · ○ no default")+'</div>'
      +'<div class="ref-menu">'
      +'<button onclick="event.stopPropagation();uploadRef(\''+slot+'\')">Upload</button>'
      +'<button onclick="event.stopPropagation();cycleMode(\''+slot+'\')">Mode: '+mode+'</button>'
      +'<button onclick="event.stopPropagation();clearRef(\''+slot+'\')">Clear</button>'
      +'</div>';
    g.appendChild(div);
  }
}
function cycleMode(slot){const o=["upload","default","none"];REF_MODES[slot]=o[(o.indexOf(REF_MODES[slot])+1)%3];renderRefs();}
function uploadRef(slot){
  const inp=$("refFile");inp.value="";inp.onchange=async()=>{
    if(!inp.files[0])return;
    const fd=new FormData();fd.append("file",inp.files[0]);
    await fetch("/api/ref/"+slot,{method:"POST",body:fd});
    REF_MODES[slot]="upload";
    const o=await (await fetch("/api/options")).json();REFS=o.refs;renderRefs();
  };inp.click();
}
async function clearRef(slot){
  await fetch("/api/ref/"+slot,{method:"DELETE"});
  const o=await (await fetch("/api/options")).json();REFS=o.refs;renderRefs();
}
async function gen(kind){
  const out=$("out"),meta=$("meta");
  const btn=$(kind==="story"?"bStory":"bImage");
  btn.disabled=true;showTab("out");out.textContent="Generating…";meta.textContent="";
  const body={
    topic:$("topic").value,power:+$("power").value,harshness:+$("harsh").value,
    gruesome:+$("grue").value,genre:$("genre").value,humor:$("humor").value,
    art_style:$("art_style").value,
    themes:[...document.querySelectorAll(".chip.on")].map(c=>c.textContent),
    words:+$("words").value,size:$("size").value,
    use_references:$("useRefs").checked,ref_mode:REF_MODES,
    persona:$("persona").value
  };
  try{
    const r=await fetch("/api/"+kind,{method:"POST",headers:{"Content-Type":"application/json"},body:JSON.stringify(body)});
    const d=await r.json();
    if(d.error){out.innerHTML='<span class="err">'+d.error+'</span>';}
    else if(kind==="story"){
      out.innerHTML='<span class="src">source: '+d.source+'</span>'+escapeHtml(d.story);
      meta.textContent="Engine prompt:\n"+d.engine_prompt;
    }else{
      out.innerHTML='<img src="'+d.path+'" alt="generated">';
      meta.textContent="Image prompt:\n"+d.prompt+"\nReferences used: "+(d.references_used&&d.references_used.length?d.references_used.join(", "):"none");
    }
  }catch(e){out.innerHTML='<span class="err">Request failed: '+e+'</span>';}
  btn.disabled=false;
}

/* ============================= ROLEPLAY ============================= */
function initRpPanel(){
  const t=$("rpTone");
  t.addEventListener("input",e=>{const v=+e.target.value;$("rpToneVal").textContent=v;$("rpToneName").textContent=TONE[v];});
  fetch("/api/characters").then(r=>r.json()).then(d=>{
    CHARS=d.characters;
    const s=$("rpChar");s.innerHTML="";
    CHARS.forEach(c=>{const o=document.createElement("option");o.value=c.id;o.textContent=c.name;s.appendChild(o);});
    rpSelect();
  });
}
function rpSelect(){
  const c=CHARS.find(x=>x.id===$("rpChar").value)||CHARS[0];
  if(!c)return;
  $("rpCard").innerHTML="<b>"+c.name+"</b> — "+(c.card||"")+"<br><i style='color:var(--acc2)'>"+(c.speech_style||"")+"</i>";
  loadRpHistory(c.id);
}
async function loadRpHistory(cid){
  const d=await (await fetch("/api/rp/"+cid+"/history")).json();
  const chat=$("chat");chat.innerHTML="";
  (d.messages||[]).forEach(m=>addMsg(m.role,m.text,m.name));
}
function addMsg(role,text,name){
  const chat=$("chat");
  const div=document.createElement("div");div.className="msg "+(role==="user"?"user":"char");
  div.innerHTML=(role==="char"&&name?'<div class="who">'+name+'</div>':'')+escapeHtml(text);
  chat.appendChild(div);chat.scrollTop=chat.scrollHeight;
}
async function rpSend(){
  const inp=$("rpInput"),text=inp.value.trim();
  if(!text)return;
  const cid=$("rpChar").value;
  addMsg("user",text);inp.value="";inp.disabled=true;
  try{
    const r=await fetch("/api/rp/send",{method:"POST",headers:{"Content-Type":"application/json"},
      body:JSON.stringify({character_id:cid,message:text,tone:+$("rpTone").value})});
    const d=await r.json();
    if(d.error){addMsg("char","⚠ "+d.error,"system");}
    else{const c=CHARS.find(x=>x.id===cid);addMsg("char",d.reply,c?c.name:"");}
  }catch(e){addMsg("char","⚠ request failed","system");}
  inp.disabled=false;inp.focus();
}
function rpNewChar(){$("rpNewForm").style.display=$("rpNewForm").style.display==="none"?"":"none";}
async function rpCreateChar(){
  const body={name:$("ncName").value,speech_style:$("ncStyle").value,catchphrase:$("ncCatch").value,
    default_line:$("ncDefault").value,soft_line:$("ncSoft").value,card:$("ncCard").value};
  if(!body.name)return;
  await fetch("/api/characters",{method:"POST",headers:{"Content-Type":"application/json"},body:JSON.stringify(body)});
  $("rpNewForm").style.display="none";
  const d=await (await fetch("/api/characters")).json();CHARS=d.characters;
  const s=$("rpChar");s.innerHTML="";
  CHARS.forEach(c=>{const o=document.createElement("option");o.value=c.id;o.textContent=c.name;s.appendChild(o);});
  s.value=CHARS[CHARS.length-1].id;rpSelect();
}
async function rpResetChat(){
  const cid=$("rpChar").value;
  await fetch("/api/rp/"+cid+"/history",{method:"DELETE"});
  $("chat").innerHTML="";
}

/* ============================= GALLERY ============================= */
async function loadGallery(){
  const g=$("gallery");g.innerHTML="";
  const d=await (await fetch("/api/gallery")).json();
  d.images.forEach(it=>{
    const img=document.createElement("img");img.src=it.url;
    img.onclick=()=>{showTab("out");
      $("out").innerHTML='<img src="'+it.url+'" style="max-width:100%;border-radius:10px">';
      $("meta").textContent="";};
    g.appendChild(img);
  });
  if(!d.images.length)g.innerHTML='<div style="color:var(--dim)">Nothing yet — generate something.</div>';
}

function escapeHtml(s){return s.replace(/&/g,"&amp;").replace(/</g,"&lt;").replace(/>/g,"&gt;")}
renderLeft("gen");
</script>
</body>
</html>

FROM python:3.12-slim
WORKDIR /app
COPY requirements.txt .
RUN pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements.txt
COPY . .
EXPOSE 8000
CMD ["uvicorn", "server:app", "--host", "0.0.0.0", "--port", "8000"]

# PROJECT FILE MAP — Personal Creative Engine v7

Project root: `/mnt/agents/output/app/`

| File | Role | Edit this when... |
|---|---|---|
| `engine.py` | All creative logic (no web code) | You want to change dials, personas, prompts, refusal behavior |
| `server.py` | FastAPI web layer, gateway calls | Routes fail, loops, image/gateway errors |
| `static/index.html` | The entire UI (single file) | Buttons, layout, sliders, gallery |
| `index.html` | Copy of `static/index.html` for the version manager | Refresh it after editing `static/index.html` |
| `Dockerfile` | Container build | Deployment issues |
| `requirements.txt` | Python deps | Import errors |
| `FILE_MAP.md` | This file | — |
| `generated/` | All generated images (gallery reads this) | Disk cleanup |
| `uploads/refs/` | YOUR reference uploads (scene/character/pose) | Replacing references outside the UI |
| `uploads/defaults/` | Default reference images (fallbacks) | Setting new defaults |
| `data/` (auto-created) | Character cards + RP chat history (JSON) | Resetting characters/chats — delete `characters.json` / `chats.json` |

## engine.py section banners (search these)
- `[ENUMS]` — POWER_LEVEL, EXPLICIT_LEVEL, HARSHNESS_LEVEL, GRUESOME_LEVEL, CONTENT_TYPE
- `[TAXONOMIES]` — DARK_FICTION_GENRES, DARK_HUMOR_STYLES, DARK_ART_STYLES, DARK_VISUAL_ELEMENTS, MATURE_THEMES
- `[MODIFIERS]` — INTENSITY_MODIFIERS, HARSHNESS_MODIFIERS, GRUESOME_STORY, GRUESOME_IMAGE
- `[SAFETY]` — HARD_BOUNDARY_TERMS, verify_safety(), SAFETY_REFUSAL  ← edit refusal text here
- `[CLASSIFY]` — classify_content()
- `[PERSONAS]` — PERSONAS dict (Mei/Georgia/Zoey/Scarlet), _PERSONA_LINES
- `[PROMPT BUILDERS]` — build_story_prompt(), build_image_prompt()
- `[LOCAL COMPOSER]` — compose_story_local()  ← zero-token story path

## Common fixes
- **Story loop / repeated lines** → `compose_story_local()` in engine.py — the
  `random.seed(...)` line controls reproducibility; beats count is
  `max(2, min(8, round(words / 120)))`.
- **Gateway image errors** → `image()` in server.py — the envelope parser
  handles both `{"media": ...}` and `{"is_success": ...}` shapes.
- **Upload errors** → `_to_public_url()` in server.py — checks `signed_url`
  then falls back to the envelope shape.
- **Turn the paid chat model back on** → set env `MEI_CHAT=1` before launching
  uvicorn. Default is zero-token local composer.
- **After editing `static/index.html`** → refresh the root copy:
  `cat static/index.html > index.html` (the version manager reads the root one).

## Run locally
```bash
cd /mnt/agents/output/app
uvicorn server:app --port 8000
# with paid stories (optional):  MEI_CHAT=1 uvicorn server:app --port 8000
```

